  "title": "Frank H NDE 7740",
  "date": "7/30/2015",
  "content": "I remember feeling like I was going to pass out from being light-headed. I did pass out and hit the floor. I can remember a brief moment of darkness. Then I was in a room…but not really a room. It was just a big open space with a pure white background and glow. I was not aware of a body and I floated into the space, but I did not feel that I was floating. I was not standing on anything. I was floating towards a group of people who were out of focus. I could not identify who they were, but they were dressed in regular clothing. One person was yelling at me, 'You're not supposed to be here.' I was still a distance away from them. Then in a flash, I was aware of my surroundings and watching the gentleman who was giving me CPR. I heard my wife telling me, 'Please don't leave me!' I remember feeling very alert, warm and calm when I woke up. I was not scared and was at peace remembering my experience. I now know that there is a God and life after our death. I do not want to stand on a pillar and proclaim it, but I feel comfortable with my experience. I wish I knew what my purpose for being alive is.",
